Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Example registry row for the open-model conversion provider (64-bit view).
; The bundle installer writes the same values. Order matters for an installer: Version is
; written LAST (the "row complete" marker the service re-describes on). Importing this file
; is a dev convenience only.
;
; Settings\<KEY> is read by the provider through host->get_setting(); the environment variable
; DXR_CONV_OPEN_CONVERSION_<KEY> in the service's environment overrides it. Keys: README.md.

